#. TRANSLATORS: MDX-derived text from packages/learn/quick-help.mdx
msgid "<b>A</b> (Accumulator): Main register for calculations and data manipulation"
msgstr "<b>A</b>（累加器）：用于计算与数据处理的主寄存器"

#. TRANSLATORS: MDX-derived text from packages/learn/quick-help.mdx
