#~ msgid "Because the snake's length is stored in zero page <tt>$03</tt>, we can use indirect addressing to draw the snake. The basic idea is to loop through the zero page locations that store the snake's position data, and use indirect addressing to draw each segment to the display."
#~ msgstr "由于蛇的长度存储在零页 <tt>$03</tt>，我们可以使用间接寻址来绘制蛇。基本思路是遍历存储蛇位置数据的零页位置，然后使用间接寻址将每个段绘制到显示区。"

#~ msgid "Before we get started, let's look at the memory layout for this program. Memory locations <tt>$00</tt> and <tt>$01</tt> are reserved for storing the location of the apple. Memory location <tt>$02</tt> stores the snake's direction, and <tt>$03</tt> stores the snake's length. Memory locations <tt>$10</tt> through <tt>$15</tt> store the snake's position data. Each pair of bytes represents a position on the screen."
#~ msgstr "开始前，我们先看看该程序的内存布局。<tt>$00</tt> 与 <tt>$01</tt> 用于存储苹果位置。<tt>$02</tt> 存储蛇的方向，<tt>$03</tt> 存储蛇的长度。<tt>$10</tt> 到 <tt>$15</tt> 存储蛇的位置数据。每对字节代表屏幕上的一个位置。"

#~ msgid "But what is all this code? Assembly language is not like other languages you might be familiar with, like JavaScript or Python. It's much lower level, and it's very specific to the processor it's running on. In our case, that's the 6502 processor. The 6502 is an 8-bit processor from the 1970s, and was the brains of many classic games, like Asteroids, Pacman, and Donkey Kong. It's also the processor used in the Apple II, Commodore 64, and Atari 2600."
#~ msgstr "但这些代码是什么？汇编语言不像你熟悉的 JavaScript 或 Python。它更底层，且与运行的处理器密切相关。我们使用的是 6502 处理器。6502 是 1970 年代的 8 位处理器，是许多经典游戏的核心，如小行星、吃豆人与大金刚。它也是 Apple II、Commodore 64 与 Atari 2600 所使用的处理器。"

#~ msgid "Carry Flag: Set when an arithmetic operation results in a carry out of the most significant bit. Used in multi-byte arithmetic operations and comparisons. Cleared by CLC, set by SEC, and automatically set/cleared by ADC/SBC instructions based on operation results."
#~ msgstr "进位标志（C）：当算术运算导致最高位产生进位时置位。用于多字节算术运算与比较。通过 CLC 清除，SEC 置位，ADC/SBC 指令根据运算结果自动置位/清除。"

#~ msgid "Compare the assembled code with the disassembly of the same code. The opcodes are the same, but the addressing is different. <tt>85 02</tt> vs <tt>8d 02 00</tt>."
#~ msgstr "比较汇编代码与相同代码的反汇编。操作码相同，但寻址方式不同。<tt>85 02</tt> 与 <tt>8d 02 00</tt>。"

#~ msgid "Comparing the two loops"
#~ msgstr "比较两个循环"

